IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g1-first-schedule`
IMPORT `g1-interpretation`

-- g1-tests-interpretation.l4: tests of g1-interpretation.l4 (ss.1 and 2).  Group G1.
-- Every expected value is decided from the text of s.2 as printed (inputs/law.wiki lines 40 to 66, checked on gazette
-- pages 182 and 183), before any rule was run: grade 1 is a licence for a system "up to 18 kW", grade 2 "up to 70 kW",
-- grade 3 "any" system; "up to" includes the limit (the ordinary sense, and s.9(a)(1), which says "over 70 kW" for the
-- systems beyond grade 2).

§ `Tests of Chapter 1`

§§ `s.2 grade 1, grade 2 and grade 3 licences: the capacity limits, both sides of each`

`a system of 0.5 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 0.5, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 5 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 5, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 17.99 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 17.99, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 18 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 18, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 18.01 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 18.01, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 69.99 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 69.99, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 70 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 70, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 70.01 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 70.01, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 71 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 71, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 1000 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 1000, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 100000 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 100000, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 0 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 0, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of minus 5 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 0 MINUS 5, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY

-- The kinds that cover a system, the limits included.
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 0.5 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 5 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 17.99 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 18 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 18.01 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 69.99 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 70 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 70.01 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 71 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 1000 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 3 licence`)
-- Grade 3 is a licence for any system: there is no upper limit.
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 100000 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 3 licence` `a system of 100000 kW`

-- Each kind on its own.
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 1 licence` `a system of 18 kW`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 1 licence` `a system of 18.01 kW`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 2 licence` `a system of 70 kW`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 2 licence` `a system of 70.01 kW`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 3 licence` `a system of 1000 kW`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 2 licence` `a system of 18 kW`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 2 licence` `a system of 71 kW`

-- A capacity that is not above zero is not a capacity: nothing is answered where a limit would be read.
#ASSERT REFUSED `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 0 kW`
#ASSERT REFUSED `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of minus 5 kW`
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 1 licence` `a system of 0 kW`
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 2 licence` `a system of minus 5 kW`

-- The reading where "up to" stops short of the limit is callable, and gives its own answers.
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system, "up to" read as excluding the limit` `a system of 17.99 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system, "up to" read as excluding the limit` `a system of 18 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system, "up to" read as excluding the limit` `a system of 69.99 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system, "up to" read as excluding the limit` `a system of 70 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system, "up to" read as excluding the limit` `a system of 1000 kW` EQUALS (LIST `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `licence kinds that cover a cooling system, "up to" read as excluding the limit` `a system of 0 kW`

-- "licence": any one of three kinds.
#ASSERT `s 2 — the kinds of licence` EQUALS (LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`)
#ASSERT count `s 2 — the kinds of licence` EQUALS 3

§§ `s.2 "licensee"`

#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the person is a licensee` (EMPTY)
#ASSERT `s 2 — the person is a licensee` (LIST `grade 1 licence`)
#ASSERT `s 2 — the person is a licensee` (LIST `grade 3 licence`, `grade 1 licence`)

§§ `s.2 the offices: the Council, the Registrar, the Minister`

#ASSERT `s 2 — the body is the Council` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the body is the Council` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 — the person is the Registrar` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the person is the Registrar` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 — the person is the Minister` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the person is the Minister` FALSE

§§ `s.2 "the Training Division"`

`a division that does both` MEANS `Facts about a division under section 2` WITH
    `a division for vocational training and manpower development` IS TRUE
    `responsible for granting trade certificates as meant in Chapter 3 of the Employment Service Law` IS TRUE
`a division that only trains` MEANS `Facts about a division under section 2` WITH
    `a division for vocational training and manpower development` IS TRUE
    `responsible for granting trade certificates as meant in Chapter 3 of the Employment Service Law` IS FALSE
`a division that only certifies` MEANS `Facts about a division under section 2` WITH
    `a division for vocational training and manpower development` IS FALSE
    `responsible for granting trade certificates as meant in Chapter 3 of the Employment Service Law` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `s 2 — the division is the Training Division` `a division that does both`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the division is the Training Division` `a division that only trains`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the division is the Training Division` `a division that only certifies`

§§ `s.2 "inspector" and "the senior inspector"`

`a Ministry employee authorised as an inspector` MEANS `Facts about a Ministry employee under section 2` WITH
    `an employee of the Ministry` IS TRUE
    `authorised by the Minister under section 30(a)` IS TRUE
    `authorised by the Minister as a senior inspector under section 34(a)` IS FALSE
`a Ministry employee authorised as a senior inspector` MEANS `Facts about a Ministry employee under section 2` WITH
    `an employee of the Ministry` IS TRUE
    `authorised by the Minister under section 30(a)` IS TRUE
    `authorised by the Minister as a senior inspector under section 34(a)` IS TRUE
`a Ministry employee with no authorisation` MEANS `Facts about a Ministry employee under section 2` WITH
    `an employee of the Ministry` IS TRUE
    `authorised by the Minister under section 30(a)` IS FALSE
    `authorised by the Minister as a senior inspector under section 34(a)` IS FALSE
`an outsider authorised as an inspector` MEANS `Facts about a Ministry employee under section 2` WITH
    `an employee of the Ministry` IS FALSE
    `authorised by the Minister under section 30(a)` IS TRUE
    `authorised by the Minister as a senior inspector under section 34(a)` IS TRUE
`an employee authorised as senior only` MEANS `Facts about a Ministry employee under section 2` WITH
    `an employee of the Ministry` IS TRUE
    `authorised by the Minister under section 30(a)` IS FALSE
    `authorised by the Minister as a senior inspector under section 34(a)` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `s 2 — the person is an inspector` `a Ministry employee authorised as an inspector`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the person is the senior inspector` `a Ministry employee authorised as an inspector`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the person is an inspector` `a Ministry employee authorised as a senior inspector`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the person is the senior inspector` `a Ministry employee authorised as a senior inspector`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the person is an inspector` `a Ministry employee with no authorisation`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the person is the senior inspector` `a Ministry employee with no authorisation`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the person is an inspector` `an outsider authorised as an inspector`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the person is the senior inspector` `an outsider authorised as an inspector`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the person is the senior inspector` `an employee authorised as senior only`

§§ `s.2 "refrigerant" and "cooling system"`

`a refrigerating gas` MEANS `Facts about a substance under section 2` WITH `a gas or a liquid` IS TRUE, `enables the removal of heat` IS TRUE
`a gas that removes no heat` MEANS `Facts about a substance under section 2` WITH `a gas or a liquid` IS TRUE, `enables the removal of heat` IS FALSE
`a solid that removes heat` MEANS `Facts about a substance under section 2` WITH `a gas or a liquid` IS FALSE, `enables the removal of heat` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `s 2 — the substance is a refrigerant` `a refrigerating gas`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the substance is a refrigerant` `a gas that removes no heat`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the substance is a refrigerant` `a solid that removes heat`

`an air conditioner` MEANS `Facts about a thing offered as a cooling system under section 2` WITH
    `a system, an installation or a product` IS TRUE
    `its purpose is to remove heat to the outside of a given substance or space` IS TRUE
    `heat is removed by means of a refrigerant` IS TRUE
`a heater` MEANS `Facts about a thing offered as a cooling system under section 2` WITH
    `a system, an installation or a product` IS TRUE
    `its purpose is to remove heat to the outside of a given substance or space` IS FALSE
    `heat is removed by means of a refrigerant` IS TRUE
`a fan` MEANS `Facts about a thing offered as a cooling system under section 2` WITH
    `a system, an installation or a product` IS TRUE
    `its purpose is to remove heat to the outside of a given substance or space` IS TRUE
    `heat is removed by means of a refrigerant` IS FALSE
`a bare idea` MEANS `Facts about a thing offered as a cooling system under section 2` WITH
    `a system, an installation or a product` IS FALSE
    `its purpose is to remove heat to the outside of a given substance or space` IS TRUE
    `heat is removed by means of a refrigerant` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `s 2 — the thing is a cooling system` `an air conditioner`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the thing is a cooling system` `a heater`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the thing is a cooling system` `a fan`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the thing is a cooling system` `a bare idea`

§§ `s.2 "work on a cooling system": an act of a kind the First Schedule lists`

`facts with neither limit` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS FALSE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS FALSE
`facts with the accessories limit` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS TRUE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS FALSE
`facts with the electrical limit` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS FALSE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS TRUE

-- An act that amounts to no listed activity is not work.
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` NOTHING `facts with neither limit`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` NOTHING `facts with the electrical limit`
-- A listed activity is work.
#ASSERT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `A.1(1) checking the permitted refrigerant quantity`) `facts with neither limit`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `B.1(4) checking or repairing refrigerant leaks`) `facts with neither limit`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`) `facts with neither limit`
-- Connecting accessories is work only where the accessories are integral.
#ASSERT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `A.1(11) connecting integral control and monitoring accessories only`) `facts with the accessories limit`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `A.1(11) connecting integral control and monitoring accessories only`) `facts with neither limit`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `A.1(11) connecting integral control and monitoring accessories only`) `facts with the electrical limit`
-- Electrical work is work only in the integral electrical system.
#ASSERT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `A.1(12) electrical work in the integral electrical system only`) `facts with the electrical limit`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `A.1(12) electrical work in the integral electrical system only`) `facts with neither limit`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `B.1(14) electrical work in the integral electrical system only`) `facts with the electrical limit`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` (JUST `B.1(14) electrical work in the integral electrical system only`) `facts with the accessories limit`

§§ `s.2 "final certificate"`

`a Division certificate with the whole exam` MEANS `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
    `issued by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS TRUE
    `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a practical exam` IS TRUE
    `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS FALSE
    `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS FALSE
`a Division certificate with no practical exam` MEANS `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
    `issued by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS TRUE
    `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a practical exam` IS FALSE
    `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS FALSE
    `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS FALSE
`a Division certificate with no theoretical exam` MEANS `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
    `issued by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS TRUE
    `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS FALSE
    `the exam included a practical exam` IS TRUE
    `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS FALSE
    `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS FALSE
`a Division certificate with no exam passed` MEANS `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
    `issued by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS TRUE
    `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS FALSE
    `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a practical exam` IS TRUE
    `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS FALSE
    `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS FALSE
`a Division certificate with no studies` MEANS `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
    `issued by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS FALSE
    `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a practical exam` IS TRUE
    `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS FALSE
    `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS FALSE
`a certificate of another issuer with the whole exam` MEANS `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
    `issued by the Training Division` IS FALSE
    `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS TRUE
    `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS TRUE
    `the exam included a practical exam` IS TRUE
    `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS FALSE
    `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS FALSE
`a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate` MEANS `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
    `issued by the Training Division` IS FALSE
    `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS FALSE
    `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS FALSE
    `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS FALSE
    `the exam included a practical exam` IS FALSE
    `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS TRUE
    `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS TRUE
`a Ministry of Education certificate of other studies` MEANS `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
    `issued by the Training Division` IS FALSE
    `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS FALSE
    `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS FALSE
    `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS FALSE
    `the exam included a practical exam` IS FALSE
    `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS TRUE
    `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate under paragraph (1)` `a Division certificate with the whole exam`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `a Division certificate with the whole exam`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate under paragraph (2)` `a Division certificate with the whole exam`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `a Division certificate with no practical exam`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `a Division certificate with no theoretical exam`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `a Division certificate with no exam passed`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `a Division certificate with no studies`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `a certificate of another issuer with the whole exam`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate under paragraph (2)` `a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate under paragraph (1)` `a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `a Ministry of Education certificate of other studies`

-- The Second Schedule calls each certificate of its vocabulary a final certificate.
#ASSERT `the Second Schedule calls the certificate a final certificate` `a Training Division certificate of grade 1`
#ASSERT `the Second Schedule calls the certificate a final certificate` `a Training Division certificate of grade 2`
#ASSERT `the Second Schedule calls the certificate a final certificate` `a Training Division certificate of grade 3`
#ASSERT `the Second Schedule calls the certificate a final certificate` `a Training Division certificate with no grade stated`
#ASSERT `the Second Schedule calls the certificate a final certificate` `a certificate of the Training Division vocational school for youth`
#ASSERT `the Second Schedule calls the certificate a final certificate` `a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate of 3 study units`
#ASSERT `the Second Schedule calls the certificate a final certificate` `a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate of 5 study units`
